  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Afghanistan - UN Women country programme support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activity will support (1) core funding to grassroots women&#x2019;s organisations; (2) strengthening livelihood opportunities through access to entrepreneurship skills, finance, and markets; (3) access to quality support services to women and girl survivors of violence, and those at risk; and (4) increasing avenues for consultations with women across the country to ensure their priorities inform UN Member States&#x2019; decision-making and programming.</narrative>
  </description>
